{"id":"wb-6-511","name":"崇教兴福寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崇教兴福寺塔","text":"崇教兴福寺塔位于中国江苏省常熟市大东门内，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n崇教兴福寺塔始建于南宋建炎四年（1130年），咸淳八年（1272年）重修。抗日战争期间底层副阶被炸毁。中华人民共和国成立后多次重修。塔身平面呈方形，共九层，砖身木檐楼阁式，立面轮廓呈抛物线形，塔内有木质楼梯。崇教兴福寺塔不仅是佛塔，还具有风水塔的意义，是佛塔演变为风水塔的重要实例。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%87%E6%95%99%E5%85%B4%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89838646,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89838646","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/09f844e7ea4789f5978366b5.jpg","title":"常熟宋崇教兴福寺方塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B8%B8%E7%86%9F%E5%AE%8B%E5%B4%87%E6%95%99%E5%85%B4%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA%E6%96%B9%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/%E5%B8%B8%E7%86%9F%E5%AE%8B%E5%B4%87%E6%95%99%E5%85%B4%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA%E6%96%B9%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Haier7917","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​更多haier7917的中国古建照片：https://www.panoramio.com/user/1500781","width":320,"height":441},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}